{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "只对你说谎",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 50.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 4 月，LayerZero 给 KelpDAO 确认跨链消息的验证者，放行了一条消息。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 4 月，LayerZero 给 KelpDAO 确认跨链消息的验证者，放行了一条消息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 1.702,
   "speechEnd": 8.956
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "这条消息，在源链上根本不存在。",
   "spoken": "这条消息，在源链上根本不存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 9.34,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 9.434,
   "speechEnd": 11.989
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "验证者读链，靠的是两个 RPC 节点。",
   "spoken": "验证者读链，靠的是两个 RPC 节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.44,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 12.532,
   "speechEnd": 15.669
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "攻击者控制了这两个节点，替换了节点程序。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制了这两个节点，替换了节点程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 16.1,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 16.1,
   "speechEnd": 19.547
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "被替换的节点，只对验证者返回伪造数据。",
   "spoken": "被替换的节点，只对验证者返回伪造数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 20.0,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 20.103,
   "speechEnd": 23.803
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "对别的 IP 来的查询，它返回真实数据。",
   "spoken": "对别的 IP 来的查询，它返回真实数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.22,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 24.32,
   "speechEnd": 27.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "攻击者再用 DDoS，打掉没被攻破的外部 RPC。",
   "spoken": "攻击者再用 DDoS，打掉没被攻破的外部 RPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 27.8,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 27.893,
   "speechEnd": 31.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "系统自动切换，切到了被污染的节点上。",
   "spoken": "系统自动切换，切到了被污染的节点上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 32.42,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 32.514,
   "speechEnd": 36.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "LayerZero 的声明写，损失约 2.9 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "LayerZero 的声明写，损失约 2.9 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 36.56,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 36.655,
   "speechEnd": 40.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 41.1,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 41.1,
   "speechEnd": 41.901
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "监控系统也查询了这两个节点，结果一切正常。",
   "spoken": "监控系统也查询了这两个节点，结果一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 42.36,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 42.36,
   "speechEnd": 45.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "它能发现这次攻击吗？",
   "spoken": "它能发现这次攻击吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 46.18,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 46.18,
   "speechEnd": 47.669
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "先记住这个问题。",
   "spoken": "先记住这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 48.36,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "speechStart": 48.36,
   "speechEnd": 49.321
  }
